<title>POLAND: WBK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 156.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 156.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.12 vs    8.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.45 vs   13.26</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 43.45 vs   34.58</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	74.42 vs   63.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					156.88 vs  115.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  223.54 vs  190.60</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		442.40 vs  365.38</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     804.57 vs  682.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
